# The build context holds only the Cargo workspace files and the
# manifests and sources of the `idle` and `display` crates, so a change
# to any other file, including the tests in `idle/tests/`, does not
# rebuild the screen images.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!idle/Cargo.toml
!idle/src/
!display/Cargo.toml
!display/src/
